  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Pawan Kumar vs The State Of Bihar on 16 May, 2014 Author: Akhilesh Chandra Bench: Akhilesh Chandra In The High Court Of Judicature At Patna Criminal Miscellaneous No.13537 of 2014 ====================================================== Pawan Kumar, Son of Sri Rajendra Prasad .... .... Pet Versus The State of Bihar .... .... Opposite ====================================================== Coram: Honourable Mr. Justice Akhilesh Chandra Oral Order",
    "facts": "The petitioner is apprehending his arrest in a case registered for the offence punishable under Sections 341, 323, 353, 427, 504/34 of the Indian Penal Code and 31, 62, 63 of the Food Safety and Standard Act, 2006. The petitioner's prayer made under Section 438 Cr.P.C. was turned down on 24.04.2013 passed in A.B.P. No. 5661 of 2012 by Special Judge, Food Safety Act, Patna, and after playing with the law for substantial period this application has been filed only on 19.03.2014.",
